  "story": "Buildings stand side by side along a street, each one metre wide, listed with their heights. An advertiser wants to paint one rectangular billboard across the fronts of neighbouring buildings; it can be no taller than the lowest building it covers. What is the largest area such a billboard can have? A long street must be measured within budget.",
